@host = http://localhost:5156

### 1. Sisselogimine töötajana (kopeeri token muutujasse @staffToken)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff@varjupaik.ee",
  "password": "Staff123!"
}

### 2. Registreerimine (uus külastaja, roll Visitor)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mari@test.ee",
  "name": "Mari Maasikas",
  "password": "mari123"
}

### 3. Sisselogimine külastajana (kopeeri token muutujasse @visitorToken)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mari@test.ee",
  "password": "mari123"
}

### Tokenid (kleebi siia login päringu vastusest)
@staffToken = PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN
@visitorToken = PASTE_VISITOR_TOKEN

### 4. Avalik nimekiri (kõik loomad)
GET {{host}}/api/animals

### 5. Avalik nimekiri filtritega
GET {{host}}/api/animals?species=Koer&status=Available

### 6. Otsing, sorteerimine ja leheküljed
GET {{host}}/api/animals?search=sõbralik&sortBy=name&page=1&pageSize=5

### 7. Üks loom
GET {{host}}/api/animals/1

### 8. Looma ei leitud (404)
GET {{host}}/api/animals/9999

### 9. Lisa loom (Staff), multipart/form-data
POST {{host}}/api/animals
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=piir

--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Name"

Pätu
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Species"

Koer
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Age"

2
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Mänguhimuline kutsikas
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Status"

Available
--piir--

### 10. Lisa loom ilma tokenita (401)
POST {{host}}/api/animals
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=piir

--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Name"

Test
--piir--

### 11. Muuda looma (Staff)
PUT {{host}}/api/animals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=piir

--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Name"

Muri
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Species"

Koer
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Age"

4
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Sõbralik ja rõõmsameelne koer
--piir
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Status"

Available
--piir--

### 12. Kustuta loom (Staff)
DELETE {{host}}/api/animals/11
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 13. Adopteerimise taotlus (Visitor)
POST {{host}}/api/animals/1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Mul on suur aed ja palju aega koeraga jalutamiseks."
}

### 14. Taotlus vigaste andmetega (400)
POST {{host}}/api/animals/1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### 15. Taotlus töötaja tokeniga (403)
POST {{host}}/api/animals/1/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Töötaja ei saa taotlust esitada."
}

### 16. Kõik taotlused (Staff)
GET {{host}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 17. Ainult uued taotlused (Staff)
GET {{host}}/api/applications?status=New
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 18. Minu taotlused (Visitor)
GET {{host}}/api/applications/my
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorToken}}

### 19. Taotluse kinnitamine (Staff), loom muutub olekusse Adopted
PATCH {{host}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### 20. Taotluse tagasilükkamine (Staff), loom muutub vajadusel jälle Available
PATCH {{host}}/api/applications/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected"
}

### 21. Külastaja ei tohi taotlust menetleda (403)
PATCH {{host}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{visitorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved"
}

### 22. Looma veterinaarivisiitide ajalugu (Staff)
GET {{host}}/api/animals/1/vet-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 23. Lisa veterinaarivisiit (Staff)
POST {{host}}/api/animals/1/vet-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visitDate": "2026-11-12",
  "reason": "Kontroll",
  "notes": "Kõik korras.",
  "vet": "Dr. Tamm"
}

### 24. Visiit ilma põhjuseta (400)
POST {{host}}/api/animals/1/vet-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visitDate": "2026-11-12",
  "vet": "Dr. Tamm"
}
